// Internal comparison tool: ten copy variants of /minimal, side by side.
// Same verified facts, different writing. Every claim traces to the repo:
//   Zig core + per-cell diffing   packages/core/src/zig/{renderer,buffer}.zig
//   TS/React/Solid, one renderer  packages/{core,react,solid}
//   Yoga flexbox compiled in      packages/core/src/zig/build.zig.zon
//   Built-in components + keys    packages/core/src/renderables/{Select,Textarea}.ts
//   Audio (MP3/FLAC streams, mic) packages/core/src/audio.ts, zig/audio.zig
//   Images (PNG/JPEG/WebP/GIF)    packages/core/src/image.ts, renderables/Image.ts
//   Three.js via WebGPU           packages/three
//   Headless test renderer        packages/core/src/testing/test-renderer.ts
//   SSH serving                   packages/ssh
//   Single-file builds            docs/reference/standalone-executables
//   C ABI (315 export fn)         packages/core/src/zig/lib.zig
//   "Powers OpenCode today"       README.md line 9
// Delete this page once a variant is chosen.
